	<key>readme</key>
	<string>Search Datadog from Alfred.

dd mon checkout     → monitors matching "checkout"
dd apm api          → APM services matching "api"
dd dash sales       → dashboards matching "sales"
dd logs service:x   → log search
dd traces …         → trace search
dd checkout         → pick which product to search

Short aliases: m/mon, a/apm/svc, d/dash/db, l/logs, t/traces.
↩ open in browser · ⌘↩ copy URL · ⌘C copy URL

Set your Datadog host (e.g. myorg.datadoghq.com) and APM env in Configure Workflow.</string>
